    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10647" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">constrictīvus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>drawing together, contracting, astringent</i> (in later medic.
			writers): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cibi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Tard. 2, 3 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virtutis esse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Acut. 2, 18 al.</span></i>
			—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">constrictīvē</span></b> , <i>astringently</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tractare aliquid,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Acut. 3, 4, 38</span></i>
			.</div>
